Can I eat this? Does Not Contain helps you answer this "simple" question in regards to your food allergy or intolerance.

Does Not Contain was created with a simple mission… to help people answer one simple question: “Can I eat this?”

If you or someone you care for suffers from a food allergy, or food intolerance our app is here to help you find products that are suitable for you quickly and easily.

Does Not Contain app helps you determine if the chosen product is suitable for your allergy or intolerance.

Use the app in-store when shopping or at home when you are validating a product.
You should always read the label before purchasing or consuming a product, especially if you have a life-threatening allergy. The app is a guide to help you narrow down the list quickly but No app should be used as a replacement and guarantee for such conditions.

Key features;

Create your personal allergy profile;
Scan a barcode to determine suitability;

WARNING: This application and the information that it contains do NOT constitute medical advice and should NOT serve as the basis for any medical decision by you or anyone else. Please consult with your doctor or dietitian should you have questions regarding information on any product identified as suitable by this application. We always recommend you read the product label before consuming any product.
